    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is this authentic Rommanel jewellery?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Every piece we sell is authentic Rommanel, a Brazilian jewellery brand founded in 1986.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it good for sensitive skin?",
            "answer": "<p>Rommanel jewellery is hypoallergenic and nickel-free, designed with sensitive skin in mind.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I get my jewellery wet?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Rommanel pieces are water-resistant, so washing your hands or getting caught in the rain won't harm them. They are not waterproof: take them off for the beach, the pool and hot showers, because salt, chlorine and hot water wear the gold layer faster and can loosen stones.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does shipping take?",
            "answer": "<p>Orders are packed within 1–2 business days and sent with Australia Post. Standard delivery takes 2–4 business days in WA and 4–8 to other states, and Express is faster. Shipping is free on orders over $149.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I find my ring size?",
            "answer": "<p>Measure the inside diameter of a ring that fits you well and compare it with our ring size guide. If you are between sizes, choose the larger one.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
